  <<set $engagement += 2>>
  <<set $sanity += 1>>
  <<set $trust_supervisor -= 1>>
<<else>>
  // anti‑hero
  You clamp down feelings and follow orders.  Timmy’s mental state worsens.  Deep inside, anger smoulders. #line:0bf7c8f 
  <<set $engagement += 3>>
  <<set $sanity -= 2>>
  <<set $trust_timmy -= 2>>
<<endif>>
<<jump R1_D3_EndOfDay>>

